[ 'V' BIND V 1 DROP V -1 DROP SUB 'D' BIND [ TRUE ] D D MUL 0 GT CONCAT 'S' BIND 1 0 S SELECT 0 [ ADD ] SCAN 'ID' BIND ID V GROUP VALUES ] 'E0C.RUNS' DEF
[ [ ' ' 2 COLLECT JOIN ] MAP JOIN TRIM ] 'E0C.SPJOIN' DEF
[ ' ' TOKENIZE [ '' EQ NOT ] FILTER ] 'E0C.WORDS' DEF
[ JSON-DECODE 'orders' GET ] 'E0C.ORDERS' DEF
[ 'OS' BIND OS [ 'sku' GET ] MAP OS [ 'qty' GET ] MAP GROUP 'G' BIND G KEYS G VALUES [ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] MAP RECORD ] 'E0C.SKUQTY' DEF
[ CHARS [ 'C' BIND [ 1 -1 2 -2 ] '()[]' C SEARCH GET ] MAP ] 'E0C.CODES' DEF
[ E0C.CODES [ 0 ] [ 'C' BIND 'S' BIND S -1 DROP S C 1 COLLECT CONCAT 2 COLLECT 0 1 S -1 GET C ADD 0 EQ SELECT GET ] FOLD ] 'E0C.REDUCE' DEF
[ E0C.CODES [ 'C' BIND 1 -1 C 0 GT SELECT ] MAP ] 'E0C.STEPS' DEF
1
'N' BIND 0 199 RANGE N [ 'I' BIND 'X' BIND 1 X 2 DIV 3 X MUL 1 ADD X 2 DIV FLOOR 2 MUL X EQ SELECT X 1 EQ SELECT ] SCAN N 1 COLLECT CONCAT [ 1 GT ] FILTER LENGTH
